<title>BULGARIA: Bulgaria offers 10 bln levs 3-mth T-bills Monday.</title>
<headline>Bulgaria offers 10 bln levs 3-mth T-bills Monday.</headline>
<dateline>SOFIA 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bulgaria's Finance Ministry will offer at an auction on Monday 10 billion levs of three-month discount T-bills with no minimum acceptable price set in advance, the central bank said.</p>
<p>Details of the offer follow:</p>
<p> Issue number	   BG3041297006</p>
<p> Maturity		 three months</p>
<p> Par value		10 bln levs</p>
<p> Auction date	   July 21</p>
<p> Issue date	     July 23</p>
<p> Maturity date	  October 22</p>
<p>-- Sofia Newsroom, (++359-2) 91188</p>
</text>
